<title>NIGERIA: Nigerian Union Bank half-yr profit up.</title>
<headline>Nigerian Union Bank half-yr profit up.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year result for Union Bank of Nigeria to end-March 1997. (In million naira)</p>
<p>				 1997	 1996</p>
<p> Gross earnings	     5,000  vs 5,600</p>
<p> Profit before taxation	603 vs 569.5</p>
<p> Taxation			150.7 vs 142.2</p>
<p> Profit after taxation     452.2 vs 427.2</p>
<p>($1=85 naira)</p>
<p>-- Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17 REUTER STR JIJ</p>
</text>
